# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# La Sabrosita production workspace
#
# Rule of thumb: client SOURCE media belongs in this repo (through Git
# LFS). Anything a machine can regenerate does not.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------

# --- Rendered video and render output ------------------------------
# TV renders and Remotion output are regenerated from code plus the
# masters, so the code and the masters are what deserve version
# history. A single 4K render is larger than every asset in this repo
# combined, and it changes on every run.
#
# This is a blanket rule on purpose. If the client ever hands over real
# SOURCE footage that has to be kept, add it deliberately with
# `git add -f` and add a matching line to .gitattributes so it goes
# through LFS instead of landing in Git as a raw blob.
*.mp4
*.mov
*.webm
*.avi
*.mkv
*.prores
*.mxf

# Remotion / render output directories
motion/out/
motion/build/
motion/.remotion/
out/
build/
dist/

# --- Dependencies --------------------------------------------------
node_modules/
.pnp
.pnp.js
.yarn/
bower_components/

# --- Secrets -------------------------------------------------------
# Never. Not even "temporarily". This repo is private, but private is
# not the same as safe — every collaborator and every clone gets them.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.keystore
credentials.json
secrets.json
service-account*.json

# --- OS junk -------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
.fseventsd
.VolumeIcon.icns
.AppleDouble
.LSOverride
Icon?
ehthumbs.db
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# --- Temporary and working files -----------------------------------
*.tmp
*.temp
*.swp
*.swo
*~
*.bak
*.orig
*.log
.cache/
.tmp/
tmp/
scratch/

# Adobe / editor scratch — the working file is not the deliverable
*.psb
*.aep
Adobe Premiere Pro Auto-Save/
Adobe After Effects Auto-Save/

# --- Editor / tooling ----------------------------------------------
.vscode/
.idea/
*.sublime-workspace

# Local Claude Code settings are per-machine, not project state
.claude/settings.local.json

# --- Explicitly NOT ignored ----------------------------------------
# assets/** is the point of this repo. It is tracked through Git LFS,
# configured in .gitattributes. Do not add an assets/ ignore rule.
